OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALondon tourism tax capped at 5%,
OL,4,Amayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon's tourism levy will be capped at
OL,7,F5% of the cost of accommodation, the
OL,8,Fmayor has said.
OL,10,FSir Sadiq Khan said he "strongly"
OL,11,Fwelcomed plans unveiled by the
OL,12,Fgovernment on Thursday granting mayors
OL,13,Fin England the power to set an
OL,14,Fovernight visitors' levy - often dubbed
OL,15,Fas a tourism tax.
OL,17,FThe government has not set a cap on the
OL,18,Flevy percentages mayors can implement,
OL,19,Fbut Sir Sadiq told BBC London that the
OL,20,Fcapital's would not be above 5% of the
OL,21,Fcost of an overnight stay - the exact
OL,22,Ffigure has not been determined.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
